      "result": "<task id=\"ses_f0f9be47cffeJqfmvMhC7s04bM\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n# Template instantiation map — four internal A2E apps\n\nScope inspected: `packages/twenty-apps/internal/{a2e-documents,a2e-projects,a2e-accounting,a2e-drive}` plus the shared contract in `twenty-shared`. No files were modified.\n\n## Headline finding\n\nAll four apps expose exactly one template-facing logic function, `list-template-descriptors`, and it is **read-only** (`handler = async () => ({ templates: ... })`). There is **no `create-from-template` / apply / instantiate-by-key logic function anywhere** in these four apps. The only actual instantiation implementation is a **front-component-local function in a2e-documents** that copies by document record id (not by descriptor key). a2e-projects, a2e-accounting and a2e-drive have **no callable instantiate path at all** — only install-time `post-install` seeding. The M9a-2 gallery (US-118) that would call these is not built.\n\n---\n\n## Shared contract\n\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/application/templateDescriptorType.ts`\n  - `TemplateDescriptor` (line 47): `{ key, version, labels{fr,en}, category, preview[], requiredApps[], inputs[] }`\n  - `category` union (line 21): `'Pages' | 'Projets' | 'Bilan' | 'Archive' | 'Agenda' | 'Automatisations'`\n  - `TemplateDescriptorPreviewWrite` (line 41): `{ object, summary, count }`\n  - Comment at line 31 documents `required` drives the gallery's \"Use template\" enablement.\n- Guards: `templateDescriptorGuards.ts` (same dir) — `isTemplateDescriptor`, `validateTemplateDescriptors`.\n\nThe intended consumer is documented in `tasks/prd.json:365`: *\"Preview pane renders the descriptor's preview; 'Use template' instantiates through the app's existing template path (fresh IDs, provenance); 'Blank' keeps the existing blank-creation flow.\"* US-118 is planned, not shipped.\n\n---\n\n## 1. a2e-documents (`a2e-documents`, v0.2.7)\n\n### Lib constants / helpers\n\n- `src/lib/starter-templates.ts`\n  - `STARTER_DOCUMENT_TEMPLATES: StarterDocumentTemplate[]` (line 11) — 20 `{ title, markdown }` entries; titles are prefixed `Modèle — `.\n  - `findMissingStarterTemplates(existingTemplateTitles: string[]): StarterDocumentTemplate[]` (line 114).\n- `src/lib/document-template-descriptors.ts`\n  - `buildDocumentTemplateDescriptors(): TemplateDescriptor[]` (line 75) — one descriptor per starter; `key` = slug via `toDocumentTemplateKey(title)` (line 50), `version: 1`, `category: 'Pages'` (line 16), `preview` = one `document` row (line 64), `requiredApps: []` (line 19), `inputs: []`.\n- `src/lib/instantiate-template.ts` (payload construction only; caller owns persistence)\n  - `buildTemplateCopyPayload(source: TemplateCopySource, options?): TemplateCopyPayload` (line 195) → `{ title, kind: DOCUMENT, position: 'V', content }`.\n  - `readAuthorizedTemplateCopySource(fetched): TemplateCopySource | null` (line 182) — fail-closed permission gate.\n  - `remapTemplateBlockIds(blocknote, options?): string | null` (line 128) — re-keys BlockNote block anchors, skips `threadId`.\n  - `buildTemplateCopyTitle` (line 171), `TEMPLATE_TITLE_PREFIX = 'Modèle — '` (line 41), `DEFAULT_TEMPLATE_COPY_POSITION = 'V'` (line 46).\n- `src/lib/save-document-as-template.ts`\n  - `buildSaveAsTemplatePayload` (line 47), `buildTemplateDuplicatePayload` (line 63).\n- `src/lib/template-gallery.ts`\n  - `collectGalleryTemplates(flatDocuments)` (line 9) — local in-app gallery (filters `kind === TEMPLATE && archivedAt === null`). This is *not* the M9a-2 cross-app gallery.\n- `src/lib/record-note-copy.ts:116` reuses `remapTemplateBlockIds` for record-note copy.\n\n### The real instantiate path (front components, keyed by document id)\n\n- `src/front-components/document-browser.front-component.tsx`\n  - `instantiateTemplate(templateDocument: DocumentNode)` (line 424): fresh fetch by id → `readAuthorizedTemplateCopySource` (line 451) → `buildTemplateCopyPayload` (line 457) → `createDocuments` mutation (line 459) → `reloadTree()`.\n  - Wired to gallery rows via `onInstantiate` (lines 828, 847).\n- `src/front-components/document-page.front-component.tsx`\n  - `instantiateTemplate()` (line 165): copy from `record`, `createDocuments` (line 181), then `navigate(AppPath.RecordShowPage, { objectNameSingular: 'document', objectRecordId })` (line 207). Button label `\"Utiliser ce modèle\"` (line 249).\n\nThere is **no logic-function wrapper** around this; it is inline component logic.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/` (9 files)\n\n`document-content.logic-function.ts`, `guard-document-parent-cycle.ts`, `guard-document-revision-save.ts`, `improve-document-writing.logic-function.ts`, `list-template-descriptors.ts`, `post-install.ts`, `purge-archived-documents.ts`, `summarize-document.logic-function.ts`, `translate-document.logic-function.ts`.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/handlers/` (3 files)\n\n`document-action-handler.ts`, `document-content-handler.ts`, `purge-archived-documents-handler.ts`. None touch templates.\n\n### The only template-creating write: install-time seeding\n\n- `src/logic-functions/post-install.ts`\n  - `seedGettingStartedDocument(client)` (line 53) — creates the welcome `DOCUMENT`.\n  - `seedStarterTemplates(client): Promise<number>` (line 94): reads existing `kind: 'TEMPLATE'` titles, deltas via `findMissingStarterTemplates`, then one `createDocuments` mutation with `kind: 'TEMPLATE'` and `markdown` (line 105). This is the **only** path that turns `STARTER_DOCUMENT_TEMPLATES` into records.\n  - Wrapped in `definePostInstallLogicFunction({ universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.postInstall, name: 'post-install', ... })` (line 141).\n\n### `list-template-descriptors` logic function\n\n- `src/logic-functions/list-template-descriptors.ts`\n  - handler (line 12): `async () => ({ templates: buildDocumentTemplateDescriptors() })` — no input.\n  - `defineLogicFunction({ universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.listTemplateDescriptors, name: 'list-template-descriptors', timeoutSeconds: 30 })` (line 16).\n\n### Logic-function ids (`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts`)\n\n- `postInstall: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000001'`\n- `purgeArchivedDocuments: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000002'`\n- `guardDocumentParentCycle: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000003'`\n- `documentContent: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000004'`\n- `guardDocumentRevisionSave: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000005'`\n- `summarizeDocument: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000006'`\n- `translateDocument: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000007'`\n- `improveDocumentWriting: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000008'`\n- `listTemplateDescriptors: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000009'`\n\n---\n\n## 2. a2e-projects (`a2e-projects`, v0.1.16)\n\n### Lib constants\n\n- `src/lib/starter-projects.ts`\n  - `STARTER_PROJECT_TEMPLATES: StarterProjectTemplate[]` (line 29) — 12 entries `{ name, key, status, health, description, tasks[], milestones[] }`; keys `LIV, EVT, SPR, CNT, REC, ONB, WEB, SEM, AGA, SUB, BUG, OBJ`.\n  - `resolveMilestoneDueAt(dueInDays, now): string` (line 274).\n  - `findMissingStarterProjects(existingProjectKeys: string[]): StarterProjectTemplate[]` (line 284).\n- `src/lib/project-template-descriptors.ts`\n  - `buildProjectTemplateDescriptors(): TemplateDescriptor[]` (line 40). `key` = the project `key` (`LIV`…, line 78), `version: 1`, `category: 'Projets'` (line 16), `preview` = `project` (1) + `task` (tasks.length) + `milestone` (milestones.length) (lines 42–75), `requiredApps: []` (line 20), `inputs: []`.\n\n### Instantiate path: does not exist\n\n- Only install-time seeding: `src/logic-functions/post-install.ts`\n  - `findExistingProjectKeys(client)` (line 23); `createStarterProject(client, starterProject, now)` (line 43) creates the project (`createProjects`, line 48), then tasks (`createTasks`, line 79) and milestones (`createMilestones`, line 97).\n  - `handler` (line 112) deltas via `findMissingStarterP