a2e-chat, a2e-drive, a2e-crm.\n- `constants/A2eSuiteApplicationGroupHeadings.ts:6` — maps a2e-projects universal id → `'Bureau'`; consumed in `side-panel/pages/search/hooks/useAppSearchResultItems.ts:76` to relabel Cmd+K app-provider result groups. **Directly relevant to gallery/command grouping.**\n- Tests: `constants/__tests__/*`.\n\n**Hooks**\n- `hooks/useA2eSuiteApplications.ts:15` — installed vs available A2E apps.\n- `hooks/useApplyWorkspaceTemplate.ts:22` — simple legacy apply mutation.\n- `hooks/useApplyWorkspaceTemplateOperation.ts:41` — idempotent operation-based apply (idempotency key per hook instance), returns `{ applyTemplateOperation, resetOperation, operationResult, operationErrorCode, idempotencyKey, isLoading }`.\n- `hooks/useWorkspaceTemplatePreview.ts:15` — preview query, skips until a template is selected.\n- Tests under `hooks/__tests__/`.\n\n**GraphQL** — `graphql/queries/workspaceTemplatePreview.ts`, `graphql/mutations/applyWorkspaceTemplate.ts`, `graphql/mutations/applyWorkspaceTemplateOperation.ts`.\n\n**Types** — `types/apply-template-operation.types.ts` (`ApplyTemplateResult`, `TemplatePreview`, `ApplyTemplateStep`, `ApplyTemplateErrorCode`, …).\n\n**Utils** — `utils/getApplyTemplateResultOutcome.ts`, `utils/resolveTemplatePreview.ts`, `utils/getWorkspaceTemplateSetupErrorCode.ts` (+ tests).\n\nThere is **no gallery** (`TemplateGallery` does not exist anywhere in the repo) and no a2e-specific side-panel page yet. The closest \"gallery\" primitives are the template **picker grid** above.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Existing modal / panel hosts that could host a gallery\n\n- **Side panel page (recommended, matches Cmd+K):** add a component to `SIDE_PANEL_PAGES_CONFIG` (`SidePanelPagesConfig.tsx:42`). List scaffolding: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/components/SidePanelList.tsx` and `SidePanelGroup.tsx` (used by `SidePanelCommandMenuItemDisplayPage` and `SidePanelCreateRelatedRecordPage`).\n- **Generic modal:** `packages/twenty-ui/src/sur