gine-component-key.enum.ts`.\n2. Define it in `standard-command-menu-item.constant.ts`.\n3. Map the key in `EngineComponentKeyHeadlessComponentMap.tsx:59` to `<HeadlessOpenSidePanelPageEngineCommand page={SidePanelPages.TemplatesGallery} …/>` (same shape as `SEARCH_RECORDS`, lines 198-205).\n4. Regenerate GraphQL types (`npx nx run twenty-front:graphql:generate`) and add a DB migration/upgrade command if the standard constant changes (per `AGENTS.md` Gotchas).\n\nNo files were modified.\n</task_result>\n</task>",
