d` (line 457) → `createDocuments` mutation (line 459) → `reloadTree()`.\n  - Wired to gallery rows via `onInstantiate` (lines 828, 847).\n- `src/front-components/document-page.front-component.tsx`\n  - `instantiateTemplate()` (line 165): copy from `record`, `createDocuments` (line 181), then `navigate(AppPath.RecordShowPage, { objectNameSingular: 'document', objectRecordId })` (line 207). Button label `\"Utiliser ce modèle\"` (line 249).\n\nThere is **no logic-function wrapper** around this; it is inline component logic.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/` (9 files)\n\n`document-content.logic-function.ts`, `guard-document-parent-cycle.ts`, `guard-document-revision-save.ts`, `improve-document-writing.logic-function.ts`, `list-template-descriptors.ts`, `post-install.ts`, `purge-archived-documents.ts`, `summarize-document.logic-function.ts`, `translate-document.logic-function.ts`.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/handlers/` (3 files)\n\n`document-action-handler.ts`, `document-content-handler.ts`, `purge-archived-documents-handler.ts`. None touch templates.\n\n### The only template-creating write: install-time seeding\n\n- `src/logic-functions/post-install.ts`\n  - `seedGettingStartedDocument(client)` (line 53) — creates the welcome `DOCUMENT`.\n  - `seedStarterTemplates(client): Promise<number>` (line 94): reads existing `kind: 'TEMPLATE'` titles, deltas via `findMissingStarterTemplates`, then one `createDocuments` mutation with `kind: 'TEMPLATE'` and `markdown` (line 105). This is the **only** path that turns `STARTER_DOCUMENT_TEMPLATES` into records.\n  - Wrapped in `definePostInstallLogicFunction({ universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.postInstall, name: 'post-install', ... })` (line 141).\n\n### `list-template-descriptors` logic function\n\n- `src/logic-functions/list-template-descriptors.ts`\n  - handler (line 12): `async () => ({ templates: buildDocumentTemplateDescriptors() })` — no input.\n  - `defineLogicFunction({ universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.listTemplateDescriptors, name: 'list-template-descriptors', timeoutSeconds: 30 })` (line 16).\n\n### Logic-function ids (`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts`)\n\n- `postInstall: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000001'`\n- `purgeArchivedDocuments: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000002'`\n- `guardDocumentParentCycle: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000003'`\n- `documentContent: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000004'`\n- `guardDocumentRevisionSave: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000005'`\n- `summarizeDocument: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000006'`\n- `translateDocument: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000007'`\n- `improveDocumentWriting: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000008'`\n- `listTemplateDescriptors: 'c31a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000009'`\n\n---\n\n## 2. a2e-projects (`a2e-projects`, v0.1.16)\n\n### Lib constants\n\n- `src/lib/starter-projects.ts`\n  - `STARTER_PROJECT_TEMPLATES: StarterProjectTemplate[]` (line 29) — 12 entries `{ name, key, status, health, description, tasks[], milestones[] }`; keys `LIV, EVT, SPR, CNT, REC, ONB, WEB, SEM, AGA, SUB, BUG, OBJ`.\n  - `resolveMilestoneDueAt(dueInDays, now): string` (line 274).\n  - `findMissingStarterProjects(existingProjectKeys: string[]): StarterProjectTemplate[]` (line 284).\n- `src/lib/project-template-descriptors.ts`\n  - `buildProjectTemplateDescriptors(): TemplateDescriptor[]` (line 40). `key` = the project `key` (`LIV`…, line 78), `version: 1`, `category: 'Projets'` (line 16), `preview` = `project` (1) + `task` (tasks.length) + `milestone` (milestones.length) (lines 42–75), `requiredApps: []` (line 20), `inputs: []`.\n\n### Instantiate path: does not exist\n\n- Only install-time seeding: `src/logic-functions/post-install.ts`\n  - `findExistingProjectKeys(client)` (line 23); `createStarterProject(client, starterProject, now)` (line 43) creates the project (`createProjects`, line 48), then tasks (`createTasks`, line 79) and milestones (`createMilestones`, line 97).\n  - `handler` (line 112) deltas via `findMissingStarterProjects` and loops `createStarterProject`.\n  - `definePostInstallLogicFunction({ universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.postInstall, name: 'post-install' })` (line 132).\n- No logic function accepts a project template key; no `handlers/` function applies a starter project; no front-component instantiates one.\n- `src/logic-functions/list-template-descriptors.ts`: handler `async () => ({ templates: buildProjectTemplateDescriptors() })` (line 12); `name: 'list-template-descriptors'` (line 18).\n\n### `src/logic-functions/` (14 files)\n\n`deal-won-create-channel.logic-function.ts`, `deal-won-create-project.logic-function.ts`, `extract-tasks-from-document.logic-function.ts`, `file-review-task.logic-function.ts`, `list-template-descriptors.ts`, `meeting-notes-page.logic-function.ts`, `post-install.ts`, `purge-trash.logic-function.ts`, `recurring-task-generator.logic-function.ts`, `retroplanning.logic-function.ts`, `standup-digest.logic-function.ts`, `task-breakdown-context.logic-function.ts`, `task-due-reminder.logic-function.ts`, `task-human-id.logic-function.ts`.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/handlers/` (13 files)\n\n`apply-retroplanning-handler.ts`, `deal-won-create-channel-handler.ts`, `deal-won-create-project-handler.ts`, `extract-tasks-from-document-handler.ts`, `file-review-task-handler.ts`, `meeting-notes-page-handler.ts`, `projects-tool-support.ts`, `purge-trash-handler.ts`, `recurring-task-generator-handler.ts`, `standup-digest-handler.ts`, `task-breakdown-context-handler.ts`, `task-due-reminder-handler.ts`, `task-human-id-handler.ts`.\n\n### Logic-function ids (`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts`)\n\n`postInstall: 'c31b0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000003'`, `purgeTrash: ...0005`, `taskHumanId: ...0007`, `recurringTaskGenerator: ...0009`, `retroplanning: ...000b`, `extractTasksFromDocument: ...000d`, `standupDigest: ...000e`, `taskBreakdownContext: ...000f`, `dealWonCreateProject: ...0010`, `dealWonCreateChannel: ...0011`, `meetingNotesPage: ...0012`, `file