eedStarterSheets` (line 143), `seedCategories` (line 65), `seedOrgProfile` (line 103).\n- `src/logic-functions/post-install.ts` calls `seedStarterFiches(client)` (line 44) inside the install step list.\n- `src/logic-functions/list-template-descriptors.ts`: handler `async () => ({ templates: buildFicheTemplateDescriptors() })` (line 11); `name: 'list-template-descriptors'` (line 17).\n- Note: `LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.renderFiche: 'b11a0000-0012-4000-8000-00000000000b'` (constants line 109) is committed but **has no corresponding logic-function file** — a reserved id only. No fiche-editor front component exists under `src/front-components/` (only `quick-entry` and `subvention-explorer`), so there is no UI apply either.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/` (12 files, plus `fetchers/`, `handlers/`, `utils/`)\n\n`generate-recurring-documents.ts`, `grant-subvention-income.ts`, `list-template-descriptors.ts`, `post-install.ts`, `refresh-subventions-now.ts`, `refresh-subventions.ts`, `rollup-budgets.ts`, `score-subventions.ts`, `stamp-invoice-number.ts`, `sweep-overdue-invoices.ts`, `sync-finance-entry-to-ledger.ts`, `sync-invoice-to-ledger.ts`.\n\n### `src/logic-functions/handlers/` (4 files)\n\n`ledger-handler.ts`, `numbering-handler.ts`, `refresh-subventions-handler.ts`, `seed-starter-content.ts`.\n\n### Logic-function ids (`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts`)\n\n`postInstall: 'b11a0000-0012-4000-8000-000000000001'`, `syncFinanceEntryToLedger: ...0002`, `syncInvoiceToLedger: ...0003`, `sweepOverdueInvoices: ...0004`, `generateRecurringDocuments: ...0005`, `rollupBudgets: ...0006`, `refreshSubventions: ...0007`, `grantSubventionIncome: ...0008`, `refreshSubventionsNow: ...0009`, `scoreSubventions: ...000a`, `renderFiche: ...000b` (no file), `stampInvoiceNumber: ...000c`, `listTemplateDescriptors: 'b11a0000-0012-4000-8000-00000000000d'`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. a2e-drive (`a2e-drive`, v0.1.3)\n\n### Lib constants\n\n- `src/lib/folder-structure-templates.ts`\n  - `FOLDER_STRUCTURE_TEMPLAT