ageTitle, pageIcon, pageId?, resetNavigationStack?, focusTitleInput? })`).\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/engine-command/components/HeadlessOpenSidePanelPageEngineCommand.tsx:10` — generic engine command that navigates to any `PurposeBuiltSidePanelPage`.\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/hooks/useSidePanelMenu.ts:22` (`useSidePanelMenu` → `openSidePanelMenu`, `closeSidePanelMenu`, `navigateSidePanelMenu`, `toggleSidePanelMenu`).\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/hooks/useOpenCreateRelatedRecordInSidePanel.ts:11` — pattern of setting a component-scoped state then navigating with a page id.\n- Cmd+K mount/hotkeys: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/ui/layout/page/components/MainAppLayoutWithSidePanel.tsx:47-50` and `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu/hooks/useCommandMenuHotKeys.ts:11-30` (`meta+k`/`ctrl+k` → `toggleSidePanelMenu`).\n- Container: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu/components/CommandMenuOpenContainer.tsx:44`.\n\n### 1g. Server-side registration (if the command must be a metadata item)\n- Enum: `packages/twenty-server/src/engine/metadata-modules/command-menu-item/enums/engine-component-key.enum.ts` (e.g. `CREATE_NEW_RECORD = 'CREATE_NEW_RECORD'`, line 6).\n- Standard definitions table: `packages/twenty-server/src/engine/workspace-manager/twenty-standard-application/constants/standard-command-menu-item.constant.ts` (`STANDARD_COMMAND_MENU_ITEMS`, entries have `universalIdentifier`, `label: i18nLabel(...)`, `engineComponentKey`, `availabilityType` — e.g. lines 50-71 for `CREATE_NEW_RECORD`).\n- Materialization: `.../utils/command-menu-item/create-standard-command-menu-item-flat-metadata.util.ts:10`.\n- Mock for front tests: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/command-menu-item/mock/command-menu-items.mock.tsx:7` (`createMockCommandMenuItems`).\n\n---\n\n## 2. \"New\" / create surfaces\n\n### 2a. Core mutation hook\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/hooks/useCrea