es/create-related-record/components/SidePanelCreateRelatedRecordPage.tsx:70` + opener `.../side-panel/hooks/useOpenCreateRelatedRecordInSidePanel.ts:11`.\n- Object options / view create: `record-table/record-table-section/components/RecordTableRecordGroupAddNewGroup.tsx`, `views/view-picker/components/ViewPickerCreateButton.tsx`.\n- Note: there is **no** `CreateRecordButton` or `ObjectRecordCreate` component; the old `AddRecordDropdown`-style surface has been replaced by the inline \"+\" rows and the Cmd+K `CREATE_NEW_RECORD` command.\n\n---\n\n## 3. `a2e-workspace` module — inventory & summary\n\nPath root: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/`\n\n**Components**\n- `components/A2eWorkspaceTemplatePicker.tsx:69` — grid of workspace templates (cards), selects one and renders the preview. Props `{ options, onApplied? }`. Reused by both onboarding and Settings (parity-tested).\n- `components/A2eWorkspaceTemplatePreview.tsx:284` — full preview/apply panel: per-app install resolution, optional-app checkboxes, navigation changes, sample content, step-by-step apply status, distinct failure panels. Uses `useWorkspaceTemplatePreview` + `useApplyWorkspaceTemplateOperation`.\n- `components/SettingsA2eWorkspaceTemplateSection.tsx:7` — Settings `<Section>` wrapper around the picker.\n- `components/A2eSuiteApplicationCard.tsx:54` — marketplace card with Install button/readiness.\n- `components/SettingsA2eSuiteSection.tsx:22` — Settings section listing installed A2E apps + available catalog cards.\n- Tests: `components/__tests__/A2eWorkspaceTemplatePicker.test.tsx`, `A2eWorkspaceTemplatePreview.test.tsx`, `__tests__/entrypoint-parity.test.tsx`.\n\n**Constants**\n- `constants/A2eWorkspaceTemplates.ts:36` — `A2E_WORKSPACE_TEMPLATE_OPTIONS` (CRM, INDIVIDUAL, STUDENT, TEAM, NON_PROFIT, SMALL_BUSINESS) with `{ value, label, description, Icon }`.\n- `constants/A2eSuiteApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.ts:5` — universal ids for a2e-documents, a2e-accounting, a2e-projects, a2e-